    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 11,
        "x": 3,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "content": "### 📜 Job Logs (L2) — XID · Slurm · Errors\nLog-layer (L2) triage for a Slurm job. Pick a **Job ID**; the **Node** selector auto-scopes to that job's nodes (from `cgroup_info`) and every Loki panel filters on it. Use **🔍 Log Search** for free-text. This board is the log companion to the metric-layer *Single Job Stats*: here you confirm the GPUs/driver logged **no fatal XID/NCCL faults**, isolating the failure to the fabric.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "content": "### 📄 NCCL per-rank crash detail → job `.out` (head NFS)\nNCCL comm aborts / per-rank stack traces are **not** in Loki — they are written to the job's stdout on the head node's NFS share:\n```\n/nvidia-testing/llmb_ex/workloads/<workload>/…/log-<name>_<JOBID>_0.out\n```\ne.g. `…/log-nemotron-h-56b_335_0.out`. `grep -nE 'ncclRemoteError|Watchdog|NCCL WARN|Aborted' log-*_$jobid_0.out` on the head node. Loki carries **kernel/syslog/slurm** streams only.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "text"
    },
